      "dct:provenance": "Max Landsat 8 ARD (Analysis Ready Data) Surface Temperature from 7 different images ranging from 2011-2020.  Images: LE07_CU_027019_20170830_20181130_C01_V01_ST, LE07_CU_027019_20170814_20181130_C01_V01_ST, LE07_CU_027019_20120731_20190507_C01_V01_ST, LE07_CU_027019_20110915_20181212_C01_V01_ST, LE07_CU_027019_20110713_20181213_C01_V01_ST, LC08_CU_027019_20200814_20200825_C01_V01_ST, and LC08_CU_027019_20160904_20190430_C01_V01_ST  ",
