      "isAccessibleForFree": false,
      "dct:provenance": "This dataset is derived from the 2015 Miami-Dade County DEM 10ft layer found at https://gis-mdc.opendata.arcgis.com/documents/MDC::2015-miami-dade-county-dem-10ft/about. The original source data was resampled to a resolution of 100ft per pixel using the gdalwarp utility.",
