      "creativeWorkStatus": "draft",
      "disambiguatingDescription": "The University of Miami provides this data for use \"as is\". The areas depicted by this map/data are approximate, and are not accurate to surveying or engineering standards. The maps/data shown here are for illustration purposes only and are not suitable for site-specific decision making. Information found here should not be used for making financial or any other commitments. The University of Miami provides this information with the understanding that it is not guaranteed to be accurate, correct or complete and conclusions drawn from such information are the sole responsibility of the user. While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy, correctness and timeliness of materials presented, University of Miami assumes no responsibility for errors or omissions, even if University of Miami is advised of the possibility of such damage.",
