          "description": "Percentage minority (Hispanic or Latino (of any race) -- Black and African American, Not Hispanic or Latino -- American Indian and Alaska Native, Not Hispanic or Latino -- Asian, Not Hispanic or Latino -- Native Hawaiian and Other Pacific Islander, Not Hispanic or Latino -- Two or More Races, Not Hispanic or Latino -- Other Races, Not Hispanic or Latino) estimate MOE, 2016-2020 ACS",
